From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 14:02:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/26] snapshot-import: materialize remote ZIPs before parsing

Download snapshot ZIP objects into a temporary local file before opening the archive. Verify every bounded range by byte count, retry early EOFs from the start of that range, and reject inconsistent range responses instead of allowing a truncated local archive.

Keep the original streaming reader available for other storage consumers. Document provider behavior, disk cost, retry boundaries, and adoption criteria in patches/snapshot_import_zip_materialization/README.md.
